The full licence is included in the download as LICENSE.txt and published at /licence.$cv$, $cv$Questions about setup or a problem with the files? Open a support request from your account and include your order number.$cv$, 289, 'INR', c.id,
  array[$cv$/previews/website-starter-collection-1.jpg$cv$, $cv$/previews/website-starter-collection-2.jpg$cv$, $cv$/previews/website-starter-collection-3.jpg$cv$, $cv$/previews/website-starter-collection-4.jpg$cv$, $cv$/previews/website-starter-collection-5.jpg$cv$]::text[],
