The home page has a hero, a services overview, a values and team section and a clearly marked placeholder testimonials area. The about page tells your company story, the services page presents each offering in detail with an FAQ, and the contact page includes a contact form with accessible, in-browser validation.

Accessibility is built in: a skip link, labelled landmarks, visible focus styles, a mobile menu that announces its state and closes with Escape, and error messages linked to their fields. All text and illustrations are original placeholders, and the README explains how to change content, colours and fonts and how to connect the form to a form service or your own backend.$cv$, $cv$Website template$cv$,
