select $cv$E-commerce UI Starter Kit$cv$, $cv$ecommerce-ui-starter-kit$cv$, $cv$Product listing, product detail, cart and multi-step checkout interfaces.$cv$, $cv$Original e-commerce UI: product listing with filters, product detail, a working cart and a multi-step checkout layout.$cv$, $cv$The front-end screens for an online shop, ready to connect to your own catalogue and payment provider.

The listing page has a filter sidebar that becomes a drawer on mobile and a working sort control over sample data. The product page includes an image gallery with thumbnails, variant selectors, quantity input, add-to-cart and content tabs. The cart updates quantities and totals live using integer-cent arithmetic and keeps working even when browser storage is unavailable. The checkout is a multi-step layout covering contact, address and delivery, followed by a clearly labelled payment placeholder: it deliberately contains no card fields, because payments must be handled by a real payment provider’s hosted or embedded checkout. An order confirmation page completes the flow.

Prices are always read from the catalogue, never from browser storage, and tampered carts are cleaned automatically. All products, brand names and illustrations are original and fictional.$cv$, $cv$UI kit$cv$,
  array[$cv$Product grid with filters and sorting$cv$, $cv$Product page with gallery, variants and tabs$cv$, $cv$Cart with live totals (integer-cent maths)$cv$, $cv$Multi-step checkout layout with a clearly marked payment placeholder$cv$, $cv$Order confirmation page$cv$, $cv$12 original SVG product illustrations$cv$]::text[],
