select $cv$Portfolio Website Starter Kit$cv$, $cv$portfolio-website-starter-kit$cv$, $cv$A personal portfolio with filterable projects, skills, experience timeline and a case-study page.$cv$, $cv$An original portfolio layout with filterable project cards, skills, biography, experience timeline and contact section.$cv$, $cv$Present your work clearly with a portfolio that is quick to customise and easy to maintain.

The main page includes a hero with your biography, project cards that visitors can filter by tag (with an announced result count for screen-reader users), a skills section, an experience timeline and a contact form with in-browser validation. A separate case-study page gives each project room for context, process and results.

